    "description": "You can create a temporary piece of almost any type of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> from the spare parts you have around. To do so, you must make a DC 25 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mechanics\" title=\"Mechanics\">Mechanics</a> check and spend one hour building the device. The object can have a maximum value of 200 credits x your Class Level, it cannot have an availability of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Rare\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Rare\">Rare</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Illegal\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Illegal\">Illegal</a>, and it cannot be unique.<br><br>The device you create must be something that you would be reasonably familiar with, and after 24 hours the object is destroyed. You can use this Talent once per day.",
